*
!.gitignore

# Everything here is ignored by default. Only named fixtures are tracked, and a
# new project stays local unless it is added below on purpose.
#
#   default             the shipped Cortex Ignition build (formerly
#                       cortex-ignition-tech-demo-0.4b) and the New Project
#                       template. Its project.ron is include_str!'d into
#                       psxed-project and its starter assets seed every new
#                       project, so the build needs it on disk.
#   graybox-valley      outdoor traversal fixture using the Picotron grid
#   graybox-reach   large mixed outdoor/interior traversal fixture
#   grid-cathedral, grid-level008, grid-dungeon, grid-cave, grid-sewers,
#   grid-west          the six grid reference levels (permanent: the grid
#                      importer is gone, these are the fixtures). Each links
#                      its `assets` to ../graybox-reach/assets; its baked/
#                      directory is regenerated and stays ignored.
#
# Superseded level projects (0.2, 0.3, 0.4, null-choir-texture-kit, mantis,
# tech-demo) are local-only, same arrangement as editor/archive/legacy-grid/.
!default/
!default/**
!graybox-valley/
!graybox-valley/**
!graybox-reach/
!graybox-reach/**
!grid-cathedral/
!grid-cathedral/**
!grid-level008/
!grid-level008/**
!grid-dungeon/
!grid-dungeon/**
!grid-cave/
!grid-cave/**
!grid-sewers/
!grid-sewers/**
!grid-west/
!grid-west/**
# cortex-two-area-level: only the project, its own cooked textures and the two
# layout sources are tracked. review/ (candidate discs and screenshots, 8 GB),
# the generator scripts, the Blender files and the ground-paint
# and ground-v3 texture studies stay local.
!cortex-two-area-level/
!cortex-two-area-level/project.ron
!cortex-two-area-level/assets/
!cortex-two-area-level/assets/**
!cortex-two-area-level/source_assets/
!cortex-two-area-level/source_assets/layout.json
!cortex-two-area-level/source_assets/integrated.json
# The five cooked ground textures project.ron reads; the rest of ground-v3
# (source PNGs, prompts) stays local.
!cortex-two-area-level/source_assets/ground-v3/
cortex-two-area-level/source_assets/ground-v3/*
!cortex-two-area-level/source_assets/ground-v3/structure_floor_readable_128.psxt
!cortex-two-area-level/source_assets/ground-v3/structure_peeling_v3_128.psxt
!cortex-two-area-level/source_assets/ground-v3/terrain_rock_fractured_128.psxt
!cortex-two-area-level/source_assets/ground-v3/terrain_road_worn_128.psxt
!cortex-two-area-level/source_assets/ground-v3/terrain_sand_soft_ripples_v2_64.psxt
# Config for the generated world-streaming stress project (stream-world/ itself
# is regenerated on demand by gen-stream-world and stays untracked).
!stream-world.config.ron
# The per-user editor view file inside a tracked project stays local.
**/.psxed-view.ron

# Animation-generation auditions and review renders are local working inputs.
# Cooked runtime clips under assets/animations remain tracked.
default/source_assets/**/animations/candidates/
default/source_assets/**/animations/previews/
default/source_assets/**/previews/
**/cooked/
**/baked/
**/logs/
# Emulator/editor screen grabs: working output, regenerated on demand.
**/captures/
